<title>USA: Raytel settles Orlando Diagnostic dispute.</title>
<headline>Raytel settles Orlando Diagnostic dispute.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MATEO, Calif. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raytel Medical Corp said it resolved litigation that had blocked the merger of U.S. Diagnostic Inc and Medical Imaging Centers of America Inc.</p>
<p>As part of the settlement, Raytel transferred its 51 percent interest in the Orlando Diagnostic Center to Medical Imaging Centers in exchange for an undisclosed cash payment.</p>
<p>Medical Imaging had owned 49 percent of the center and the transfer of the remainder cleared the way for Medical Imaging to be acquired by U.S. Diagnostic.</p>
</text>
